<title>CHINA: Dialer and Business unit sets $40mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Dialer and Business unit sets $40mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A US$40 million floating rate notes issue has been launched for D&amp;B Holding (Bermuda), bankers said.</p>
<p>The deal is guaranteed by Dialer and Business Electronics Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The notes have a final maturity of five years with a put and a call option on the third anniversary. They were issued at par to float at 75 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>With fees, the all-in return for top-tier managers is about 80 basis points.</p>
<p>The governing law is New York law.</p>
<p>Citibank and Banque National de Paris are the arrangers for the transaction.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
